OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 7, rings bell to mark end of
OL,4,Acancer treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seven-year-old girl who is the first
OL,7,Fchild with Down's syndrome to take part
OL,8,Fin a "revolutionary" clinical trial has
OL,9,Frung the bell after completing her
OL,10,Ftreatment for acute lymphoblastic
OL,11,Fleukaemia at Alder Hey hospital in
OL,12,FLiverpool.
OL,14,FAllya, from Crewe, in Cheshire, was
OL,15,Fdiagnosed with the rare type of cancer
OL,16,Fthat affects the blood and bone marrow
OL,17,Fshortly before her fourth birthday.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
