OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 7, rings bell to mark end of
OL,4,Acancer treatment
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe has been undergoing the treatment
OL,7,Fas part of a clinical trial at the
OL,8,FMerseyside children's hospital, which
OL,9,Fhas been looking at a more targeted
OL,10,Fapproach for children who are
OL,11,Fvulnerable to infections.
OL,13,FAllya's father, Haji, said: "When I
OL,14,Fcame in here, for the first two, three
OL,15,Fdays, sometimes when I was alone I was
OL,16,Fcrying. But after time, Alder Hey is
OL,17,Flike family."
